\begin{slide}
Not Constant Coefficient
 \begin{itemize}
 \item Notice that the $F$ matrix that has emerged (implicitly) from the 9-state inertial error dynamics is not time invariant
 \item It is highly dependent on trajectory data such as acceleration and angular rate profiles
 \item These are functions of time
 \item Position dependent items such as latitude are also involved
\end{itemize}
\end{slide}
